        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, oil, at power plant
Calculation for electricity production in oil power plants with efficiency and oil input.;
UUID: 3cb9f95d-ef33-32fd-8f41-db2974cd10ed
UCTE specific efficiency of transformation
Location: Estimation for the mix of producing countries.
Technology: Estimation for average technology.
Time period: Production mix for 2000
Production volume: 121134 GWh in 2000
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3cb9f95d-ef33-32fd-8f41-db2974cd10ed.xml</text>
